{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm, Craft, and Protect your Chickens! Can you survive the night?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bill wants to Retire is the cozy shooter you've been looking for, by day farm, gather resources, play minigames, and raise your chickens because when night comes so do the wolves! Face off against hoards of wolves, foxes, and coyotes using an arsenal of weapons and towers. In a pinch? You must decide whether to sell a chicken for a quick coin boost, sacrificing both a vital resource and one of your lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Featuring three challenging maps full of scenic views, secrets, and unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Story and endless mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-4 Melee weapons, 4 guns, and 4 upgradable towers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-A cozy by day, chaotic by night gameplay loop that's easy to pick up and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543020?t=1741894733","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543020/1357d9d30217d985c386fabbdc97844924be2023/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741894733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543020/e3ffc3184157c738673b5042782430d4665e0a48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741894733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543020/e3ffc3184157c738673b5042782430d4665e0a48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741894733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm, Craft, and Protect your Chickens! Can you survive the night?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bill wants to Retire is the cozy shooter you've been looking for, by day far